---

## UI Craft: Interactive App Navigation Bar + Command Palette

**Stack:** Vanilla HTML/CSS/JS, zero dependencies · **Theme:** light + dark (auto + toggle) · **States:** complete

---

### Tokens & Architecture

| Token | Light | Dark |
|---|---|---|
| `--bg` | `#f8fafc` | `#09090b` |
| `--surface` | `#ffffff` | `#18181b` |
| `--surface-2` | `#f1f5f9` | `#27272a` |
| `--glass-bg` | `rgba(255,255,255,0.72)` | `rgba(24,24,27,0.80)` |
| `--fg` | `#0f172a` | `#fafafa` |
| `--muted` | `#64748b` | `#a1a1aa` |
| `--accent` | `#6366f1` | `#818cf8` |

Z-index scale: `--z-sticky:100` · `--z-dropdown:200` · `--z-command:300` · `--z-modal:400` · `--z-toast:500`
Radii: `--r-xs:4px` → `--r-xl:16px` · Layout: `max-width:1120px`, `4px` grid.

---

### Code

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="light">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>App Nav — Command Palette</title>
  <style>
    /* ── TOKENS ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
    :root {
      --bg:          #f8fafc;
      --surface:     #ffffff;
      --surface-2:   #f1f5f9;
      --glass-bg:    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.76);
      --glass-blur:  blur(16px);
      --line:        rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
      --line-strong: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.16);
      --fg:          #0f172a;
      --muted:       #64748b;
      --accent:      #6366f1;
      --accent-fg:   #ffffff;
      --accent-bg:   rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.10);
      --r-xs:  4px;  --r-sm:  6px;  --r-md: 10px;
      --r-lg: 14px;  --r-xl: 16px;
      --z-sticky:   100; --z-dropdown: 200; --z-command: 300;
      --z-modal:    400; --z-toast:    500;
      --ease-out: cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
      --fast: 120ms; --mid: 200ms; --slow: 240ms;
    }

    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      :root:not([data-theme="light"]) {
        --bg:          #09090b; --surface:    #18181b;
        --surface-2:   #27272a; --glass-bg:   rgba(24, 24, 27, 0.84);
        --line:        rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
        --line-strong: rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
        --fg:          #fafafa; --muted:      #a1a1aa;
        --accent:      #818cf8; --accent-fg:  #09090b;
        --accent-bg:   rgba(129,140,248,0.14);
      }
    }
    :root[data-theme="dark"] {
      --bg:          #09090b; --surface:    #18181b;
      --surface-2:   #27272a; --glass-bg:   rgba(24, 24, 27, 0.84);
      --line:        rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
      --line-strong: rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
      --fg:          #fafafa; --muted:      #a1a1aa;
      --accent:      #818cf8; --accent-fg:  #09090b;
      --accent-bg:   rgba(129,140,248,0.14);
    }

    /* ── RESET ───────────────────────────────────────────── */
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { font-size: 16px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;
      font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--fg); background: var(--bg); min-height: 100vh;
    }

    /* ── NAVBAR ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .navbar {
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: var(--z-sticky);
      width: 100%;
      background: var(--glass-bg);
      backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    @supports not (backdrop-filter: blur(1px)) {
      .navbar { background: var(--surface); }
    }
    .navbar__inner {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 24px; height: 56px;
    }
    .navbar__brand {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      text-decoration: none; color: var(--fg);
      font-size: 0.9375rem; font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em; flex-shrink: 0;
      min-height: 44px; padding: 0 4px;
      border-radius: var(--r-sm); outline-offset: 2px;
    }
    .navbar__brand:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); }
    .navbar__logo {
      width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: var(--r-sm);
      background: var(--accent);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0; color: var(--accent-fg);
    }
    .navbar__nav {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 2px;
      margin-left: 8px; position: relative;
    }
    .navbar__link {
      position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center;
      height: 44px; padding: 0 12px;
      font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: var(--r-sm); white-space: nowrap;
      transition: color var(--fast) ease;
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }
    .navbar__link:hover { color: var(--fg); }
    .navbar__link:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); color: var(--fg); }
    .navbar__link[aria-current="page"] { color: var(--fg); font-weight: 600; }
    .navbar__pill {
      position: absolute; bottom: 6px; left: 0;
      height: 2px; background: var(--accent); border-radius: 2px;
      transition: left var(--mid) var(--ease-out), width var(--mid) var(--ease-out);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .navbar__spacer { flex: 1; }
    .navbar__actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }

    /* ── CMD TRIGGER ─────────────────────────────────────── */
    .cmd-trigger {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      height: 36px; padding: 0 12px;
      background: var(--surface-2);
      border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
      border-radius: var(--r-md);
      font-size: 0.8125rem; font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--muted); cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap;
      transition: background var(--fast) ease, border-color var(--fast) ease,
                  color var(--fast) ease, transform var(--fast) ease;
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }
    .cmd-trigger:hover {
      background: var(--surface); border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--fg);
    }
    .cmd-trigger:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); color: var(--fg); }
    .cmd-trigger:active { transform: scale(0.97); }
    .cmd-trigger kbd {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 2px;
      padding: 1px 5px;
      background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
      border-radius: var(--r-xs);
      font-size: 0.6875rem; font-family: inherit;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.4;
    }

    /* ── ICON BTN ────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .btn-icon {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      width: 36px; height: 36px;
      background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--r-sm); color: var(--muted);
      cursor: pointer; outline-offset: 2px;
      transition: background var(--fast) ease, color var(--fast) ease,
                  border-color var(--fast) ease, transform var(--fast) ease;
    }
    .btn-icon:hover { background: var(--surface-2); color: var(--fg); border-color: var(--line-strong); }
    .btn-icon:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); }
    .btn-icon:active { transform: scale(0.93); }

    /* ── AVATAR ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .navbar__avatar {
      width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-fg);
      font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0; cursor: pointer; outline-offset: 2px;
      border: 2px solid var(--line-strong);
      transition: border-color var(--fast) ease;
    }
    .navbar__avatar:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); }

    /* ── HAMBURGER ───────────────────────────────────────── */
    .navbar__hamburger {
      display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      width: 44px; height: 44px;
      background: transparent; border: none;
      border-radius: var(--r-sm); color: var(--fg);
      cursor: pointer; outline-offset: 2px;
    }
    .navbar__hamburger:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); }

    /* ── COMMAND BACKDROP ────────────────────────────────── */
    .cmd-backdrop {
      position: fixed; inset: 0;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.44);
      z-index: var(--z-command);
      display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: center;
      padding: 80px 16px 16px;
      opacity: 0; pointer-events: none;
      transition: opacity var(--mid) ease;
    }
    .cmd-backdrop.is-open { opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto; }

    /* ── DIALOG ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
    dialog.cmd-dialog {
      all: unset;
      width: 100%; max-width: 600px;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
      border-radius: var(--r-xl);
      box-shadow:
        0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.08),
        0 20px 60px -8px rgba(0,0,0,0.24);
      overflow: hidden;
      transform: scale(0.96) translateY(-8px); opacity: 0;
      transition: transform var(--mid) var(--ease-out), opacity var(--mid) ease;
    }
    .cmd-backdrop.is-open dialog.cmd-dialog {
      transform: scale(1) translateY(0); opacity: 1;
    }

    /* ── SEARCH BAR ──────────────────────────────────────── */
    .cmd-search {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
      padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .cmd-search__icon { flex-shrink: 0; color: var(--muted); }
    .cmd-search__input {
      flex: 1; font-family: inherit; font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.5; color: var(--fg);
      background: transparent; border: none; outline: none; min-width: 0;
    }
    .cmd-search__input::placeholder { color: var(--muted); }
    .cmd-search__clear {
      display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      width: 24px; height: 24px;
      background: var(--surface-2); border: none;
      border-radius: var(--r-xs); color: var(--muted);
      cursor: pointer; flex-shrink: 0; outline-offset: 2px;
      transition: background var(--fast) ease, color var(--fast) ease;
    }
    .cmd-search__clear:hover { background: var(--line-strong); color: var(--fg); }
    .cmd-search__clear:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); }
    .cmd-search__input:not(:placeholder-shown) ~ .cmd-search__clear { display: flex; }

    /* ── RESULTS ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .cmd-body {
      max-height: 400px; overflow-y: auto;
      overscroll-behavior: contain;
      scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: var(--line-strong) transparent;
    }
    .cmd-section { padding: 8px 16px 4px; }
    .cmd-section__label {
      font-size: 0.6875rem; font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    .cmd-item {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
      padding: 10px 16px; cursor: pointer;
      border-radius: var(--r-sm); margin: 2px 8px;
      transition: background var(--fast) ease; outline: none;
    }
    .cmd-item:hover,
    .cmd-item[data-selected="true"] { background: var(--accent-bg); }
    .cmd-item[data-selected="true"] .cmd-item__label { color: var(--accent); }
    .cmd-item__icon {
      width: 32px; height: 32px; background: var(--surface-2);
      border-radius: var(--r-sm);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0; color: var(--muted);
    }
    .cmd-item[data-selected="true"] .cmd-item__icon {
      background: var(--accent-bg); color: var(--accent);
    }
    .cmd-item__text { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
    .cmd-item__label {
      font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--fg);
      white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;
    }
    .cmd-item__desc {
      font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--muted);
      white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;
      margin-top: 1px;
    }
    .cmd-item__kbd {
      flex-shrink: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 3px;
    }
    .cmd-item__kbd kbd {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      min-width: 20px; height: 20px; padding: 0 4px;
      background: var(--surface-2); border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
      border-radius: var(--r-xs); font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 0.6875rem; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      color: var(--muted); line-height: 1;
    }

    /* ── EMPTY STATE ─────────────────────────────────────── */
    .cmd-empty {
      display: none; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;
      justify-content: center; gap: 12px;
      padding: 48px 24px; text-align: center;
    }
    .cmd-empty.is-visible { display: flex; }
    .cmd-empty__icon {
      width: 44px; height: 44px; background: var(--surface-2);
      border-radius: var(--r-lg);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    .cmd-empty__title {
      font-size: 0.9375rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--fg);
    }
    .cmd-empty__subtitle {
      font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 280px; line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .cmd-empty__reset {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
      height: 36px; padding: 0 16px;
      background: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-fg);
      font-family: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 500;
      border: none; border-radius: var(--r-md);
      cursor: pointer; outline-offset: 2px;
      transition: opacity var(--fast) ease, transform var(--fast) ease;
    }
    .cmd-empty__reset:hover { opacity: 0.88; }
    .cmd-empty__reset:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 3px; }
    .cmd-empty__reset:active { transform: scale(0.96); }

    /* ── FOOTER HINTS ────────────────────────────────────── */
    .cmd-footer {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px;
      padding: 10px 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: var(--surface-2);
    }
    .cmd-footer__hint {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;
      font-size: 0.6875rem; color: var(--muted);
    }
    .cmd-footer__hint kbd {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      min-width: 18px; height: 18px; padding: 0 4px;
      background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
      border-radius: var(--r-xs); font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 0.625rem; color: var(--muted);
    }
    .cmd-footer__spacer { flex: 1; }

    /* ── PAGE CONTENT ────────────────────────────────────── */
    .page-content {
      max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 24px;
    }
    .page-hero { margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .page-hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem); font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.2;
      color: var(--fg); margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .page-hero p { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--muted); max-width: 56ch; }
    .hint-banner {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      background: var(--accent-bg);
      border: 1px solid rgba(99,102,241,0.3);
      border-radius: var(--r-lg);
      font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--fg);
    }
    .hint-banner kbd {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 2px;
      padding: 2px 6px;
      background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
      border-radius: var(--r-xs); font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--accent);
    }

    /* ── MATCH HIGHLIGHT ─────────────────────────────────── */
    mark.cmd-match {
      background: transparent; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700;
    }

    /* ── RESPONSIVE ──────────────────────────────────────── */
    @media (max-width: 767px) {
      .navbar__nav {
        display: none; position: absolute;
        top: 56px; left: 0; right: 0;
        background: var(--surface);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        padding: 8px 16px 12px;
        flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 2px;
        z-index: var(--z-dropdown);
      }
      .navbar__nav.is-open { display: flex; }
      .navbar__nav .navbar__pill { display: none; }
      .navbar__link[aria-current="page"] { color: var(--accent); }
      .navbar__hamburger { display: flex; }
      .cmd-trigger .cmd-trigger__label { display: none; }
      .cmd-backdrop { padding: 24px 12px 16px; }
    }

    /* ── REDUCED MOTION ──────────────────────────────────── */
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after {
        transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
      }
      dialog.cmd-dialog { transform: none !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ── NAVBAR ─────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<header class="navbar" role="banner">
  <div class="navbar__inner">

    <a class="navbar__brand" href="#" aria-label="CraftUI home">
      <span class="navbar__logo" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M8 2L14 5.5V10.5L8 14L2 10.5V5.5L8 2Z" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.9"/>
        </svg>
      </span>
      CraftUI
    </a>

    <nav class="navbar__nav" aria-label="Main navigation" id="main-nav">
      <a class="navbar__link" href="#" aria-current="page">Dashboard</a>
      <a class="navbar__link" href="#">Projects</a>
      <a class="navbar__link" href="#">Team</a>
      <a class="navbar__link" href="#">Settings</a>
      <span class="navbar__pill" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </nav>

    <div class="navbar__spacer" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="navbar__actions">

      <button
        class="cmd-trigger"
        id="cmd-open-btn"
        aria-haspopup="dialog"
        aria-label="Open command palette (Ctrl+K)"
        type="button"
      >
        <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <circle cx="6.5" cy="6.5" r="4.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <path d="M10.5 10.5L13.5 13.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
        <span class="cmd-trigger__label">Search</span>
        <kbd aria-label="Keyboard shortcut: Control K">⌃K</kbd>
      </button>

      <button class="btn-icon" id="theme-toggle" aria-label="Toggle color theme" type="button">
        <svg id="icon-sun" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <circle cx="8" cy="8" r="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <path d="M8 1v1.5M8 13.5V15M1 8h1.5M13.5 8H15M3.05 3.05l1.06 1.06M11.89 11.89l1.06 1.06M3.05 12.95l1.06-1.06M11.89 4.11l1.06-1.06"
                stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
        <svg id="icon-moon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"
             aria-hidden="true" style="display:none">
          <path d="M13.5 10A6 6 0 1 1 6 2.5a4.5 4.5 0 1 0 7.5 7.5Z"
                stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
      </button>

      <button class="navbar__avatar" aria-label="Open user menu" type="button">T</button>

      <button class="navbar__hamburger" id="nav-hamburger"
              aria-controls="main-nav" aria-expanded="false"
              aria-label="Toggle navigation" type="button">
        <svg id="icon-menu" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M3 6h14M3 10h14M3 14h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
        <svg id="icon-close-menu" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"
             aria-hidden="true" style="display:none">
          <path d="M5 5l10 10M15 5L5 15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ── COMMAND PALETTE ─────────────────────────────────────── -->
<div class="cmd-backdrop" id="cmd-backdrop" role="presentation" aria-hidden="true">
  <dialog class="cmd-dialog" id="cmd-dialog" aria-label="Command palette" aria-modal="true">

    <div class="cmd-search" role="search">
      <svg class="cmd-search__icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <circle cx="7.5" cy="7.5" r="5.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <path d="M12 12L16 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      </svg>
      <input
        type="search"
        class="cmd-search__input"
        id="cmd-input"
        placeholder="Search or jump to…"
        autocomplete="off"
        spellcheck="false"
        aria-label="Search commands"
        aria-autocomplete="list"
        aria-controls="cmd-results"
        aria-activedescendant=""
        role="combobox"
        aria-expanded="true"
      >
      <button class="cmd-search__clear" id="cmd-clear-btn" type="button"
              aria-label="Clear search" tabindex="-1">
        <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M2 2l8 8M10 2L2 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="cmd-body" id="cmd-body">
      <div id="cmd-results" role="listbox" aria-label="Search results"></div>

      <div class="cmd-empty" id="cmd-empty" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
        <div class="cmd-empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">
