---

### Interactive States & Keyboard Contract

| Input | Behavior |
|---|---|
| `Ctrl+K` / `⌘K` | Opens palette; repeating toggles it closed |
| `↑` / `↓` | Moves selection, wraps at ends, scrolls item into view |
| `Enter` | Activates selected item; closes palette |
| `Escape` | Closes palette; returns focus to trigger button |
| `Tab` | Trapped inside `<dialog>` while open |
| Click backdrop | Closes palette |
| Type in input | Live filters results; highlights match in label + desc |
| Click ✕ / "Reset search" | Clears query, restores full list, re-focuses input |

**Lifecycle states covered:** default · hover · `:focus-visible` (2px outline, all controls) · active/selected (accent tint row + text) · empty search with query echo + reset CTA · mobile nav collapsed/expanded.

**Reduced motion:** `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` disables all `transform`/`transition` while keeping selected-state colour change intact.

